\pard \s39 \li2520 \fi-604 \ri1007 \ql \f1 \b0 \fs28 \f3 -\f1 \b \'80\b0 (BOOL)\b isOneway\
\fs14\
\b0 \fs28 \pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 Returns YES if the method is asynchronous when invoked through distributed objects. In this case the sender of the remote message doesn\'27t block awaiting a reply. Returns NO otherwise.\
\fs14\
